<title>USA: Home Bancorp conversion raises $68 mln.</title>
<headline>Home Bancorp conversion raises $68 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ELGIN, Ill. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Bancorp of Elgin Inc, which on September 26 it completed its conversion to a stock form from a mutual, said the transition involved issuance and sale of 7.0 million shares of common stock at $10 per share.</p>
<p>It said net proceeds from the offering amounted to $68 million.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
